      "writtenOn": "2026-02-04T22:35:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see your point, totally agree to keep CL as simple as possible and also void adding unnecessary functionality. I think that I based on a wrong reference and that\u0027s why I ended implemented these methods, but at the moment there is no use case, so no reason to have code that in practice will not be used, so I will remove from this CL and we can revisit in a separate CL if we see the need of incorporating it.",
