      "message": "Not blocking comment / not for this CL (just something to think about):\n\nOne possible optimization here would be to only store a single row of pixels.  This can in theory reduce memory usage + improve memory cache access patterns.  OTOH, I am not sure how important it is to optimize this aspect of BMP decoding (e.g. how much it matters in the end-to-end measurements).  Still, something to think about.",
