      "side": 1,
      "message": "The limiting issue we have now is that we do not have access to single-row data on currently exposed method, as the only method exposed in image crate is read_image_data. On the first proposal (Patchset 10) we could work this way because we had `try_read_row` method. If/once we move to have bmp as a separated crate it seems we would have more flexibility and can propose this approach.",
